bin/nvidia-drivers:primary-gpu - Make NVIDIA the Xorg primary GPU.
app-lang/python:perf - Enable Linux perf profiling support with perf trampoline, frame pointers, and unstripped binaries.
app-dev/cmake:bootstrap - Build with bundled libraries and without TLS for the native bootstrap stage.
app-dev/pkgconf:build - Build the command-only Makefile.lite variant without Meson or libpkgconf.
app-lang/perl:build - Omit crypt support and post-install documentation tools for the native bootstrap stage.
